WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.168
Step 1. Open the encounter.

1.2
00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:07.710
The Procedures panel on the Overview tab lists the procedures recorded in this

1.3
00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:08.921
encounter.

2.1
00:00:08.921 --> 00:00:14.794
Step 2. Open the Procedure form. Select the Edit pencil on the Procedures panel.

2.2
00:00:14.794 --> 00:00:19.371
The form shows every procedure of this encounter as a row.

3.1
00:00:19.371 --> 00:00:21.474
Step 3. Find the procedure.

3.2
00:00:21.474 --> 00:00:26.483
A greyed-out row is marked as entered in error, and you cannot change it.

3.3
00:00:26.483 --> 00:00:30.140
You also cannot change the procedure of a row.

4.1
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.090
Step 4. Change the values in the row.

4.2
00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:37.616
You can change the date performed, the status and the outcome.

4.3
00:00:37.616 --> 00:00:41.035
Here, the outcome changes to Successful.

5.1
00:00:41.035 --> 00:00:43.495
Step 5. Change the details.

5.2
00:00:43.495 --> 00:00:49.552
Open the row menu and select Show Details, to change the approximate date,

5.3
00:00:49.552 --> 00:00:54.226
status reason, body site, reason, category or note.

6.1
00:00:54.226 --> 00:00:57.977
Step 6. Save the changes. Select Save Changes.

6.2
00:00:57.977 --> 00:01:01.630
Care saves only the procedures that you changed,

6.3
00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:05.631
and the Procedures panel shows the new values.
